{% comment %}
Cloud SQL reaches the cluster's network through private service access.
Networks used to get it from OFE's VPC template; the Toolkit's
private-service-access module must be used by a module of the same
blueprint, so it is created here, with the database that needs it.
{% endcomment %}
- source: modules/network/private-service-access
  kind: terraform
  id: slurm-psa
  use: [hpc_network]

- source: community/modules/database/slurm-cloudsql-federation
  kind: terraform
  id: slurm-sql
  use: [hpc_network, slurm-psa]
  settings:
    sql_instance_name: sql-{{ cluster_id }}
    tier: "db-g1-small"
